# DET-003 – Windows Command Shell

## Purpose

Detect execution of cmd.exe.

## MITRE ATT&CK

T1059.003

## SPL

```spl
index=sysmon cmd.exe
```

## Benign Uses

- whoami
- hostname
- ipconfig
- batch scripts

## Suspicious Uses

- Office launching cmd.exe
- Script interpreters spawning cmd.exe
- Encoded or chained commands

## Test

Executed:

cmd.exe /c whoami
cmd.exe /c hostname

Detection successfully returned both events.
